        "notes": "规则副词用 -<bdi>er / am …-sten</bdi> 构成比较级与最高级（与形容词同形）。下表是常用的不规则形式。"
      },
      {
        "id": "de-adv-pronominal",
        "title": "代副词 <bdi>da(r)- 与 wo(r</bdi>)-",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "构成与用法",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "形式",
              "用途",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "<bdi>da</bdi> + 介词",
                "代替「介词 + 事物」",
                "<bdi>damit、dafür、darüber</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>da + r</bdi> + 元音开头介词",
                "介词以元音开头时插入 <bdi>r</bdi>",
                "<bdi>darauf、daran、darum</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>wo</bdi> + 介词",
                "对「介词 + 事物」提问",
                "<bdi>womit、wovon、worüber</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>wo + r</bdi> + 元音开头介词",
                "同上",
                "<bdi>worauf、woran、worin</bdi>"
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "de"
          },
          {
            "caption": "人 <bdi>vs</bdi> 物",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "所指",
              "用什么",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "指物",
                "代副词",
                "<bdi>Worauf wartest du? — Auf den Bus.</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "指人",
                "介词 + 人称代词",
                "<bdi>Auf wen wartest du? — Auf meinen Freund.</bdi>"
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "de"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "<bdi>da(r)- / wo(r</bdi>)- 只用于指物；指人时要用「介词 + 人称代词」。"
